{
  "id": "m58l1",
  "title": {
    "es": "Direcciones IP con ipaddress",
    "en": "IP addresses with ipaddress"
  },
  "theory": {
    "es": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Trabajar con IPs sin errores"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "El módulo `ipaddress` interpreta y valida direcciones IP. `ip_address(texto)` crea el objeto; `.version` dice si es IPv4 (4) o IPv6 (6); `.is_private` indica si es una IP privada (LAN)."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "import ipaddress",
          "ip = ipaddress.ip_address('192.168.1.10')",
          "print(ip.version, ip.is_private)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "4 True"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Saber distinguir IP pública/privada y validar direcciones es básico en redes y seguridad."
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Working with IPs without errors"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "The `ipaddress` module parses and validates IP addresses. `ip_address(text)` creates the object; `.version` says whether it's IPv4 (4) or IPv6 (6); `.is_private` indicates a private (LAN) IP."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "import ipaddress",
          "ip = ipaddress.ip_address('192.168.1.10')",
          "print(ip.version, ip.is_private)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "4 True"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Telling public from private IPs and validating addresses is fundamental in networking and security."
      }
    ]
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "m58l1e1",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `es_privada(ip)` que devuelva True si la IP (texto) es privada (usa ipaddress).",
        "en": "Define `es_privada(ip)` returning True if the IP (text) is private (use ipaddress)."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "import ipaddress",
        "",
        "def es_privada(ip):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "import ipaddress",
        "",
        "def es_privada(ip):",
        "    return ipaddress.ip_address(ip).is_private"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "ipaddress.ip_address(ip).is_private."
        ],
        "en": [
          "ipaddress.ip_address(ip).is_private."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "es_privada",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                "192.168.1.1"
              ],
              "expected": true
            },
            {
              "args": [
                "8.8.8.8"
              ],
              "expected": false
            },
            {
              "args": [
                "10.0.0.5"
              ],
              "expected": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m58l1e2",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `version_ip(ip)` que devuelva 4 o 6 según sea IPv4 o IPv6.",
        "en": "Define `version_ip(ip)` returning 4 or 6 depending on IPv4 or IPv6."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "import ipaddress",
        "",
        "def version_ip(ip):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "import ipaddress",
        "",
        "def version_ip(ip):",
        "    return ipaddress.ip_address(ip).version"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          ".version devuelve 4 o 6."
        ],
        "en": [
          ".version returns 4 or 6."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "version_ip",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                "127.0.0.1"
              ],
              "expected": 4
            },
            {
              "args": [
                "::1"
              ],
              "expected": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}